-- 代买店铺出单打印机：打印机可绑定代买店铺（每店一台）并可自定义小票模板，打印任务记录业务类型、联数与失效时间。
-- print_jobs.content / errorMessage 在 MySQL 原为 VARCHAR(191)，放不下整张小票，改为 TEXT。可重复执行。
ALTER TABLE `printer_configs` MODIFY COLUMN `merchantId` VARCHAR(191) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NULL;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'printer_configs' AND column_name = 'purchaseShopId'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `printer_configs` ADD COLUMN `purchaseShopId` VARCHAR(191) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NULL AFTER `merchantId`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'printer_configs' AND column_name = 'ticketTemplate'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `printer_configs` ADD COLUMN `ticketTemplate` JSON NULL AFTER `purchaseShopId`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.statistics WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'printer_configs' AND index_name = 'printer_configs_purchaseShopId_key'), 'SELECT 1', 'CREATE UNIQUE INDEX `printer_configs_purchaseShopId_key` ON `printer_configs`(`purchaseShopId`)'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;

ALTER TABLE `print_jobs`
  MODIFY COLUMN `content` TEXT CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL,
  MODIFY COLUMN `errorMessage` TEXT CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NULL;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'print_jobs' AND column_name = 'bizType'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `print_jobs` ADD COLUMN `bizType` VARCHAR(191) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NOT NULL DEFAULT ''shop_order'' AFTER `event`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'print_jobs' AND column_name = 'bizId'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `print_jobs` ADD COLUMN `bizId` VARCHAR(191) CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci NULL AFTER `bizType`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'print_jobs' AND column_name = 'copies'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `print_jobs` ADD COLUMN `copies` INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 1 AFTER `bizId`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.columns WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'print_jobs' AND column_name = 'expiresAt'), 'SELECT 1', 'ALTER TABLE `print_jobs` ADD COLUMN `expiresAt` DATETIME(3) NULL AFTER `errorMessage`'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
SET @lm_sql = IF(EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM information_schema.statistics WHERE table_schema = DATABASE() AND table_name = 'print_jobs' AND index_name = 'print_jobs_bizType_bizId_idx'), 'SELECT 1', 'CREATE INDEX `print_jobs_bizType_bizId_idx` ON `print_jobs`(`bizType`, `bizId`)'); PREPARE lm_stmt FROM @lm_sql; EXECUTE lm_stmt; DEALLOCATE PREPARE lm_stmt;
